  "contentHtml": "<p>작년 지능형 과학실로 구입한 마이크로비트의 활용법이 없을까 하다가</p><p>이온의 전하 확인 실험에 활용해보고 싶어 실험을 계획하게 되었습니다</p><p>전기전도도 센서 없이 확인하는 방법을 찾기가 힘들어 chat GPT에게 물어본 내용입니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdb4523033649099a64e01578308d9583a849b9c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdb4523033649099a64e01578308d9583a849b9c\" data-origin-width=\"974\" data-origin-height=\"747\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66dc7a122f06e6c3efcfb11185ebb996b2a493f8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66dc7a122f06e6c3efcfb11185ebb996b2a493f8\" data-origin-width=\"1019\" data-origin-height=\"701\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07942883f3d231e5833f8b9ee529c881a0ba18d4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07942883f3d231e5833f8b9ee529c881a0ba18d4\" data-origin-width=\"864\" data-origin-height=\"678\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16c7dab1ce1203ecf9be68359b9f38064ccf4eec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16c7dab1ce1203ecf9be68359b9f38064ccf4eec\" data-origin-width=\"917\" data-origin-height=\"263\"></div><p>알려준대로 회로를 사진처럼 구성하고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3303bbfdba9a65a2e7fc20cbdc9cded337aa2e49\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3303bbfdba9a65a2e7fc20cbdc9cded337aa2e49\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><p>코드를 블록코딩으로 하고 싶어 물어봤으나 사진이 제대로 나오지 않아&#160; 참고해 간단히 블록코딩을 한 후 측정한 결과입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1e69174c1a261b773144eea0f56ba45e27cbe18\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1e69174c1a261b773144eea0f56ba45e27cbe18\" data-origin-width=\"1907\" data-origin-height=\"934\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cfb88fe65798d95571ed5ec40d89469ac78f12ac\" data-origin-width=\"1356\" data-origin-height=\"678\" style=\"width:49.55%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cfb88fe65798d95571ed5ec40d89469ac78f12ac\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16db4247f5d136bb9aaf1ba8f9e915edb6cecad3\" data-origin-width=\"1350\" data-origin-height=\"663\" style=\"width:50.45%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16db4247f5d136bb9aaf1ba8f9e915edb6cecad3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/883b6cda41cf4789a93cf2c3a3d1d04b2b14a901\" data-origin-width=\"1357\" data-origin-height=\"679\" style=\"width:49.35%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/883b6cda41cf4789a93cf2c3a3d1d04b2b14a901\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b767ff7e4336b8bc8495b9a6b03403562de61df\" data-origin-width=\"1358\" data-origin-height=\"662\" style=\"width:50.65%; margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b767ff7e4336b8bc8495b9a6b03403562de61df\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\">기준값은(1022)이고 순서대로 수돗물(865), 증류수(1020), 설탕물(876), 소금물(530)</div></div><p>증류수도 약간의 전류는 흐른다는 것도 보여줄수 있고</p><p>이론대로 수돗물과 수돗물에 설탕을 탄 용액이 비슷, 소금물이 가장 전기전도도가 크게 나타났습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79aa5123be3f61dc4384fe696bf40c1a4c11d41b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"775\" height=\"310\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79aa5123be3f61dc4384fe696bf40c1a4c11d41b\" data-origin-width=\"1895\" data-origin-height=\"757\"></div><p>수치를 참고해서 위와 같이 블록코딩하면</p><p>&#160;</p><p>전도도에 따라 다른 소리가 나오게 할 수도 있을것 같습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
